# Program is a user ready Text to voice convertor

Availabe Voice Options:6 (3 Male,3 Female) Voices

Each Voice has it own distinctive character like:
    "male": "am_michael",       # Standard American Male
    "female": "af_sarah",       # Standard American Female
    "gentleman": "bm_george",   # Distinguished British Male (Deep/Formal)
    "gentlewoman": "bf_emma",   # Elegant British Female (Formal)
    "young": "af_bella",        # Higher pitch, softer (Closest to child/young adult)
    "narrator": "am_adam"       # Good for reading books
Following the cahracter each voice shows significant change in the voice

We Will Get Option Choose A Voice after selection

You got a option to include Text and when you given text after selection of voice the passage will be limited to lines and will take time to segment into lines and will generate the voice 

